>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must have a supported numeric or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must be at least 2-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 3 (the last two dimensions of input must be non-empty when rank ≥ 2)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then ∀i ∈ [ndim(v_1) - 2, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1 else false
>>
Rule 4 (operation name should not be the literal "none")
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 ≠ "none"
